---
import Clipping from "~/components/Clipping.astro"
import Note from "~/components/Note.astro"

/* Spread 08 — stitching. Includes one drawn diagram, inline. */
---

<section class="tc-sector is-ruled" id="tc-sector-08" aria-label="Page 8: Stitching">
    <p class="spread-head t-eyebrow">
        <span>p. 08</span>
        <span class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>wednesday no. 9</span>
    </p>

    <h2 class="spread-title t-display" data-reveal><em>Stitching</em></h2>

    <p class="spread-note t-body">
        Coptic stitch, because the book should open flat and because it looks
        like hands made it. Tension is the whole thing: too loose and the
        spine sags, too tight and the thread cuts the paper.
    </p>

    <Clipping
        id="08-0"
        src="sewing"
        caption="pull toward the spine, not up"
        x={90}
        y={350}
        w={450}
        h={290}
        kind="photo"
    />

    {/* A sketch of the chain, drawn rather than pasted. */}
    <svg
        class="diagram"
        viewBox="0 0 300 110"
        width="300"
        height="110"
        style="position:absolute; left: 600px; top: 420px;"
        role="img"
        aria-label="A sketch of a coptic stitch chain across four signatures"
        data-reveal
    >
        <g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round">
            <path d="M10 20 H 290" opacity=".5" />
            <path d="M10 45 H 290" opacity=".5" />
            <path d="M10 70 H 290" opacity=".5" />
            <path d="M10 95 H 290" opacity=".5" />
            <path d="M40 20 c 10 12, 20 12, 30 0 c 10 12, 20 12, 30 0 c 10 12, 20 12, 30 0 c 10 12, 20 12, 30 0 c 10 12, 20 12, 30 0 c 10 12, 20 12, 30 0" />
            <path d="M40 45 c 10 12, 20 12, 30 0 c 10 12, 20 12, 30 0 c 10 12, 20 12, 30 0 c 10 12, 20 12, 30 0 c 10 12, 20 12, 30 0 c 10 12, 20 12, 30 0" />
            <path d="M40 70 c 10 12, 20 12, 30 0 c 10 12, 20 12, 30 0 c 10 12, 20 12, 30 0 c 10 12, 20 12, 30 0 c 10 12, 20 12, 30 0 c 10 12, 20 12, 30 0" />
            <path d="M70 20 V 95 M130 20 V 95 M190 20 V 95 M250 20 V 95" stroke-dasharray="2 4" />
        </g>
    </svg>
    <Note x={600} y={540} rotate={-2} size="sm">4 signatures · 6 holes · 2 needles</Note>

    <Clipping
        id="08-1"
        src="thread"
        caption="waxed, 1.2m per book"
        x={960}
        y={310}
        w={320}
        h={320}
        kind="polaroid"
        rotate={3}
    />
</section>

<style>
    .diagram {
        color: var(--tc-fg);
        opacity: 0;
        transition: opacity 600ms ease-out var(--reveal-delay, 0ms);
    }
    .diagram.is-revealed {
        opacity: 0.85;
    }
    @media (max-width: 810px) {
        .diagram {
            position: static !important;
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            margin-top: 24px;
            opacity: 0.85;
        }
    }
</style>
